<main id="home">
<h1 class="visually-hidden">RegSymp &mdash; an invite-only finance and fintech symposium for 99 senior leaders. Palma de Mallorca, 14&ndash;15 September 2026.</h1>

<!-- ============================= HERO ============================= -->
<section class="hero hero-editorial edition-palma" data-screen-label="01 Hero">
  <div class="hero-vignette"></div>
  <div class="hero-stage">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="hero-inner">
        <p class="invitation-signal">— By Invitation Only</p>
        <p class="h-display">The Ninety Nine.</p>
        <p class="hero-body">An invitation only gathering of 99 senior leaders in financial services. Two days. No attribution. No agenda except the one that emerges when the right people share a room.</p>

        <div class="hero-ctas">
          <a href="#agenda" class="hero-link">The Programme <span class="arrow">→</span></a>
          <a href="mailto:{{ site.email }}" class="hero-link hero-link--gold" data-invite-trigger>Request an Invitation <span class="arrow">→</span></a>
        </div>

        <div class="hero-detail-strip" aria-label="Event details">
          <div class="hero-detail-row" data-city="palma">
            <span>14–15 September 2026</span>
            <span class="hero-sep"></span>
            <span>Palma de Mallorca</span>
            <span class="hero-sep"></span>
            <span>Venue disclosed on confirmation</span>
          </div>

          <div class="hero-detail-row hero-detail-row--meta">
            <span>99 Senior Delegates</span>
            <span class="hero-sep"></span>
            <span class="hero-gold">Chatham House Rule</span>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- ============================= WHY ATTEND / THEMES ============================= -->
<section class="section dark" id="why" data-screen-label="04 Themes">
  <div class="container reveal">
    <div class="themes-editorial">
      <div class="themes-intro">
        <span class="eyebrow on-dark">The Programme Thesis</span>
        <h2 class="h2">Five critical themes<br/>for 2026.</h2>
<p class="lede on-dark">Every session at RegSymp maps to one of five themes identified as the most consequential shifts facing the financial services industry over the next 12 months.</p>
      </div>

      <ol class="themes-list" aria-label="Programme themes">
        {% for t in themes %}
        <li class="theme-row"><span class="num">{{ t.num }}</span><div><h3 class="theme-title">{{ t.title }}</h3><p>{{ t.description }}</p></div></li>
        {% endfor %}
      </ol>
    </div>

  </div>
</section>

<!-- ============================= ABOUT ============================= -->
<section class="section light" id="about" data-screen-label="03 About" style="background: var(--white);">
  <div class="container reveal">
    <div class="about-copy about-copy--centered">
      <h2 class="h2" style="margin-bottom:28px;">Across Continents, <em>One</em> Room.</h2>
      <p>Payments, AI, digital assets, tokenisation and embedded finance are reshaping how financial institutions operate, compete and grow. RegSymp convenes founders, executives, family offices and senior investors from banking, fintech, payments, wealth and digital assets to confront what the next generation of finance will demand in practice.</p>
      <p>RegSymp focuses on commercially relevant discussion, relationship building, and the operational challenges that define how the next generation of financial institutions competes. Across two days, in closed-room sessions under the Chatham House Rule, the symposium creates the conditions for candid conversation. No panels for the cameras. No attribution. No press.</p>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="about-gallery reveal" aria-label="RegSymp gallery">
    <button type="button" class="gallery-arrow gallery-arrow-prev" aria-label="Scroll gallery left" data-gallery-prev="aboutGalleryTrack">
      <svg width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5"><path d="M15 18l-6-6 6-6"/></svg>
    </button>
    <div class="gallery-track" id="aboutGalleryTrack">
      <figure class="gallery-item">
        <div class="gallery-item-img"><img src="/assets/images/carousel/daniel-frank-QP0topr6RYs-unsplash.jpg" alt="Palma de Mallorca cathedral spires seen from a balcony" loading="lazy" /></div>
      </figure>
      <figure class="gallery-item">
        <div class="gallery-item-img"><img src="/assets/images/carousel/outdoor_stone_courtyard_of_a_mallorcan_finca_at_golden_hour_terracotta_tiles_potted_olive_trees_wro_2vhdnkzryf445cns8b4n_3.png" alt="Stone courtyard of a Mallorcan finca at golden hour" loading="lazy" /></div>
      </figure>
      <figure class="gallery-item">
        <div class="gallery-item-img"><img src="/assets/images/carousel/historic_mallorcan_stone_arch_doorway_at_night_warm_amber_glow_radiating_from_within_arch_dark_silh_n96gnpqmo1q072hwb5ut_0.png" alt="Guests gathered beyond a glowing stone archway at night" loading="lazy" /></div>
      </figure>
      <figure class="gallery-item">
        <div class="gallery-item-img"><img src="/assets/images/carousel/mallorcan_stone_courtyard_at_near-night_viewed_through_ancient_limestone_arch_cobblestones_wrought__bm6msnb35r0q1ew76amo_1.png" alt="Candlelit dinner table set beneath a stone archway at dusk" loading="lazy" /></div>
      </figure>
      <figure class="gallery-item">
        <div class="gallery-item-img"><img src="/assets/images/carousel/razan-el-hout-vz4nGr-UlUw-unsplash.jpg" alt="Close-up of a candlelit table setting with roses" loading="lazy" /></div>
      </figure>
      <figure class="gallery-item">
        <div class="gallery-item-img"><img src="/assets/images/carousel/white_sailing_yacht_moves_imperceptibly_under_full_sail_through_turquoise_mallorcan_bay_golden_suns_drs0itthu9llcqixkah3_0.png" alt="Sailing yacht under full sail along the Mallorcan coast" loading="lazy" /></div>
      </figure>
    </div>
    <button type="button" class="gallery-arrow gallery-arrow-next" aria-label="Scroll gallery right" data-gallery-next="aboutGalleryTrack">
      <svg width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5"><path d="M9 6l6 6-6 6"/></svg>
    </button>
  </div>

  <div class="container reveal">
    <div class="section-head">
      <span class="eyebrow">The Format</span>
      <h2 class="h2">Two days. Closed room.<br/>No attribution.</h2>
    </div>

    <div class="format-blocks">

      <div class="format-block">
        <h3 class="h4">The sessions</h3>
        <p>Every panel and debate is chaired by a senior practitioner. Sessions run under the Chatham House Rule. Delegates speak candidly about strategy, risk, and competitive position. Nothing is recorded. Nothing is attributed.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="format-block">
        <h3 class="h4">Invite only</h3>
        <p>Every seat is curated to ensure the right mix of seniority, sector, and perspective. The Ninety Nine is an intimate group of selected leaders, investors, founders and policy makers gathered in unique settings around the world. RegSymp's invite-only symposiums create genuine connections, moving the industry forward.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="format-block">
        <h3 class="h4">The Thirty-Three</h3>
        <p>On the evening of the first day, thirty-three guests sit down to dinner. Curated by the programme chairs. Chatham House Rule. No agenda. The conversation forms when the right people share a table.</p>
      </div>

    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- ============================= WHY DELEGATES ATTEND ============================= -->
<section id="why-attend" data-screen-label="Why Attend" style="position:relative; width:100%; min-height:110vh; overflow:hidden; background:#0D1322; font-family:var(--sans);">

  <img class="why-attend-bg" src="/assets/images/sailboat-mallorca.jpg" alt="" style="position:absolute; inset:0; width:100%; height:100%; object-fit:cover; object-position:center center; z-index:0;" />

  <div style="position:absolute; inset:0; z-index:1; background:linear-gradient(to bottom, rgba(13,19,34,0.78) 0%, rgba(13,19,34,0.40) 40%, rgba(13,19,34,0.92) 100%);"></div>

  <div class="reveal" style="position:relative; z-index:2; min-height:110vh; box-sizing:border-box; display:flex; flex-direction:column; justify-content:space-between; padding:100px var(--gutter) 180px;">

    <div style="max-width:520px;">
      <div style="display:flex; align-items:center; gap:14px; margin-bottom:26px;">
        <span style="width:28px; height:1px; background:var(--gold); display:inline-block;"></span>
        <span class="invitation-signal" style="margin:0;">The Value of the Room</span>
      </div>
      <h2 class="h2" style="margin:0; color:#F6F3EC;">Why delegates attend.</h2>
    </div>

    <p style="margin:0; max-width:52ch; font-size:clamp(16px, 1.3vw, 19px); line-height:1.75; color:rgba(246,243,236,0.85); font-weight:400;">Delegates build a personal network of the leaders and experts shaping their sector, track the trends, new entrants and regulatory shifts as they emerge, and hear firsthand how peers are reading the market and positioning accordingly.</p>

  </div>
</section>

<!-- ============================= THE SETTING ============================= -->
<section data-screen-label="The Setting" style="position:relative; width:100%; min-height:90vh; overflow:hidden; background:#0D1322; display:flex; align-items:center; justify-content:center; font-family:var(--sans);">

  <img class="setting-bg-img" src="/assets/images/the-setting-palma.png" alt="" style="position:absolute; inset:0; width:100%; height:100%; object-fit:cover; object-position:center center; z-index:0;" />

  <div style="position:absolute; inset:0; z-index:1; background:linear-gradient(to bottom, rgba(13,19,34,0.820) 0%, rgba(13,19,34,0.550) 50%, rgba(13,19,34,0.820) 100%);"></div>

  <div class="reveal" style="position:relative; z-index:2; width:100%; max-width:1080px; padding:120px 40px; text-align:center; display:flex; flex-direction:column; align-items:center;">

    <div style="display:flex; align-items:center; gap:14px; margin-bottom:38px;">
      <span style="width:28px; height:1px; background:var(--gold); display:inline-block;"></span>
      <span class="invitation-signal" style="margin:0;">The Setting</span>
    </div>

    <h2 class="h2" style="margin:0; color:#F6F3EC; max-width:16ch; text-wrap:balance;">Palma de Mallorca. The venue is shared with confirmed attendees.</h2>

    <p style="margin:42px 0 0; max-width:60ch; font-family:var(--sans); font-size:clamp(16px, 1.3vw, 19px); line-height:1.75; color:rgba(246,243,236,0.72); font-weight:400;">We select the setting with the same care as the programme. Confirmed delegates receive full details,  including venue, accommodation guidance, and logistics, upon acceptance.</p>

  </div>
</section>

<!-- ============================= AGENDA ============================= -->
<section class="section dark-deep" id="agenda" data-screen-label="06 Agenda">
  <div class="container reveal">
    <div class="section-head">
      <span class="eyebrow on-dark">Two Days. Five Themes. No Attribution.</span>
      <h2 class="h2">Programme.</h2>
      <p class="lede on-dark">Every session is chaired by a practitioner and runs under the Chatham House Rule.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="tabs" role="tablist" aria-label="Programme tabs">
      <button class="tab active" role="tab" id="tab-btn-day1" aria-controls="tab-day1" aria-selected="true">Day 1</button>
      <button class="tab" role="tab" id="tab-btn-day2" aria-controls="tab-day2" aria-selected="false">Day 2</button>
    </div>

    {% for dayKey in ["day1", "day2"] %}
    <div class="tab-panel{% if loop.first %} active{% endif %}" id="tab-{{ dayKey }}" role="tabpanel" aria-labelledby="tab-btn-{{ dayKey }}">
      {% for row in agenda.palma[dayKey] %}
      <div class="agenda-row{% if row.break %} break{% endif %}"><div class="time">{{ row.time }}</div><div><div class="title">{{ row.title }}</div>{% if row.format %}<div class="format">{{ row.format }}</div>{% endif %}</div><div class="spk-meta"><span class="badge">{{ row.badge }}</span></div></div>
      {% endfor %}
    </div>
    {% endfor %}


  </div>
</section>

