      <span style="font-family:var(--sans); font-weight:500; font-size:12px; letter-spacing:0.32em; text-transform:uppercase; color:var(--gold);">XXXIII &nbsp;·&nbsp; The Thirty-Three</span>
      <span style="display:block; width:36px; height:1px; background:rgba(184,150,58,0.55);"></span>
    </div>

    <h2 class="h2 tt-heading" style="margin:0 0 32px; color:#F4EEE1;">A privately convened dinner.<br>Thirty-three guests.<br><em>Chatham House Rule.</em></h2>

    <p style="font-family:var(--sans); font-weight:400; font-size:clamp(16px, 1.4vw, 19px); line-height:1.7; max-width:540px; margin:0 auto 56px; color:rgba(241,234,220,0.78);">A seated dinner for thirty-three guests on the Sunday ahead of day one. Invitations are extended by the programme chairs. Chatham House Rule applies.</p>


